11: Race condition kya hai?
ans - Race condition tab hoti hai jab multiple threads/processes same shared data ko same time access/update karte hain, aur final result is baat par depend karta hai ki kaunsa thread pehle execute hua.

A race condition occurs when multiple concurrent threads or processes access and modify shared data without proper synchronization, causing unpredictable or incorrect results depending on the execution order.

